        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nflowchart TD\n    U[\&quot;User / Browser / Test Client\&quot;]\n\n    subgraph LOCAL[\&quot;Local Development\&quot;]\n        UI[\&quot;LedgerLock Dashboard\&quot;]\n        MOCK[\&quot;Mock Mode - Synthetic Preview\&quot;]\n        HEALTH[\&quot;GET /api/health\&quot;]\n        U --&gt; UI\n        UI --&gt; MOCK\n        UI --&gt; HEALTH\n    end\n\n    subgraph FLOCI[\&quot;Floci - Verification Context\&quot;]\n        FV[\&quot;Verification Workflow\&quot;]\n        FE[\&quot;Verification Results / Evidence\&quot;]\n        FV --&gt; FE\n    end\n\n    subgraph RENDER[\&quot;Render - Active Deployment\&quot;]\n        RD[\&quot;Deployed Application\&quot;]\n        RH[\&quot;Deployment Health / Revision Check\&quot;]\n        RD --&gt; RH\n    end\n\n    subgraph TARGET[\&quot;Intended Backend Architecture - Planned / Unverified\&quot;]\n        API[\&quot;Backend API\&quot;]\n        VALIDATE[\&quot;Server-side Input Validation\&quot;]\n        AUTH[\&quot;Authentication and Authorization\&quot;]\n        RECORD[\&quot;Canonical Audit Record\&quot;]\n        HASH[\&quot;Sequence + Previous Hash + SHA-256\&quot;]\n        STORE[\&quot;Firestore / Storage Adapter\&quot;]\n        CHECKPOINT[\&quot;Trusted Checkpoint\&quot;]\n        GATE[\&quot;Authorized Checkpoint Creation\&quot;]\n        KMS[\&quot;Cloud KMS Signing\&quot;]\n        VERIFY[\&quot;Chain and Signature Verification\&quot;]\n        LOG[\&quot;Allowlisted, Sanitized Security Logging\&quot;]\n        RESULT[\&quot;Verification Result\&quot;]\n\n        API --&gt; VALIDATE\n        VALIDATE --&gt; AUTH\n        AUTH --&gt; RECORD\n        RECORD --&gt; HASH\n        HASH --&gt; STORE\n        STORE --&gt; CHECKPOINT\n        CHECKPOINT --&gt; GATE\n        GATE --&gt; KMS\n        STORE --&gt; VERIFY\n        CHECKPOINT --&gt; VERIFY\n        KMS --&gt; VERIFY\n        VERIFY --&gt; RESULT\n        VERIFY --&gt; LOG\n    